hronized enqueue()` 只同步了 Mono 构造，真正的官方 sink emission 在订阅时发生，仍可能乱序。修复为在同一短临界区内执行“reserve + delegate.sendMessage().block()”；这里 block 只等待官方 readiness 与内存 sink admission，不等待慢 stdout，因此不会把下游 I/O 拉回请求线程，却能严格固定 reservation 与 frame 顺序。测试直接观察 transport 的结构化 output failure，而不依赖官方异常回调。"},{"id":"tool-call-call_rHcQ26Z9MDY8zK5Md01Gf0QJ","kind":"toolCall","title":"Edit ji-java\\protocols\\ji-acp-v1-server\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\acp\\v1\\OutboundAdmission.java","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_rHcQ26Z9MDY8zK5Md01Gf0QJ","sessionId":"6c38ccdd-749d-49d7-b5f6-a264d537d17c","seq":2343,"startedSeq":2337,"endedSeq":2343,"timestamp":"1788552291Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Edit","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-call_LcvaPopGV3oDf2b6bYOHyhBJ","kind":"toolCall","title":"Edit ji-java\\protocols\\ji-acp-v1-server\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\acp\\v1\\AcpV1ExtendedTransport.java","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_LcvaPopGV3oDf2b6bYOHyhBJ","sessionId":"6c38ccdd-749d-49d7-b5f6-a264d537d17c","seq":2352,"startedSeq":2346,"endedSeq":2352,"timestamp":"1788552306Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Edit","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-call_4Z3mUIc64tnNf2rZFRyZ8KCT","kind":"toolCall","title":"Edit ji-java\\protocols\\ji-acp-v1-server\\src\\test\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\acp\\v1\\AcpV1ExtendedTransportBackpressureTest.java","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_4Z3mUIc64tnNf2rZFRyZ8KCT","sessionId":"6c38ccdd-749d-49d7-b5f6-a264d537d17c","seq":2361,"startedSeq":2355,"endedSeq":2361,"timestamp":"1788552317Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Edit","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-call_9MHFIZ0r2mQV0MkKB2CzFeNl","kind":"toolCall","title":"PowerShell","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_9MHFIZ0r2mQV0MkKB2CzFeNl","sessionId":"6c38ccdd-749d-49d7-b5f6-a264d537d17c","seq":2370,"startedSeq":2